each $2000 at the start of 2026. Will BNB reach $3000? Binance allows users to save up to 25% on spot margin trading fees by using BNB. Another factor is that users can save up to 10% on futures trading expenditures with the token, which makes the Binance platform a primary choice. Binance also uses a significant portion of its earnings to buy back BNB, which supports the Binance ecosystem. The burning process also decreases the token supply and increases demand, which is expected to increase in value above $3000 in 2027, according to the Binance coin price prediction. Does BNB have a good long-term future? All cryptocurrencies involve risks and uncertainties. However, BNB has a strong market position and a management team that runs the world’s largest cryptocurrency exchange. BNB has the potential for increased utility and is expected to retain a strong position in the cryptocurrency sphere. Binance coin price prediction suggests that holding it for the long haul is a good option, with tenfold expected returns in five years and the price reaching $7,791.89 by 2031. However, one must conduct his/her own research or seek professional financial advice. Recent news/opinions on BNB BNB Chain announced the sunset plan for the BNB Chain Wallet (BEW) browser extensions. On October 15, 2025, BEW will be removed from Chrome and Firefox extension stores. Users who already have BEW installed will be able to use it, but no further updates, bug fixes, or support will be provided after this date. Users are advised by BNB Chain to opt for other wallets like Binance Wallet or any other wallet. The sunset of BEW will not affect the safety of funds as long as users have securely backed up their seed phrase or private keys. Important: The BNB Chain Wallet (BEW) browser extension will officially sunset in 15 days. For a smooth transition, users should: 🔸 Back up your seed phrase/private keys securely 🔸 Uninstall BEW once you’ve saved recovery info 🔸 Choose a new wallet for future use M